# Private working repo (BUILD_SPEC §3a): athlete/ and briefings/ ARE committed here
# so the real profile persists across disposable build containers. They are scrubbed
# from the separate public showcase copy, not by these ignore rules. Only secrets,
# ride files, and token-like files are ever excluded.

# --- Secrets & environment (secrets live ONLY as env vars, never in files) ---
.env
.env.*

# --- Token-like / credential files (never committed) ---
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.token
.netrc
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml

# --- Ride files reveal home location (§3a) ---
*.gpx
*.fit
*.tcx

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
build/
dist/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
